":"श्री नारायण स्वामी, अनुराग रस (26)","hinglishName":"shri narayan svami, anurag ras (26)","slug":"shri-narayan-svami-anurag-ras-26","biography":"","metadata":null,"imageUrl":null,"verses":[{"id":"local-212","title":"रे मन क्यों भटकत फिरत","category":"Shloka","sanskrit_text":"रे मन क्यों भटकत फिरत, भज श्री नन्दकुमार।नारायण अबहूँ समझ भयो न कछु बिगार॥","hindi_text":"अरे मन, अनंत कोटि जन्मों से तू क्यों भटक रहा है, अब श्री कृष्ण का भजन कर। श्री नारायण स्वामी कहते हैं कि अभी भी कुछ नहीं बिगड़ा है, इस बात को समझ और शरणागत हो जा।","english_text":null,"english_translation":"Oh mind, why are you wandering from uncountable lifetimes, now practice devotion to Shri Krishn. Still there is an opportunity and it's not too late, understand and surrender to God!","description":"https://www.brajrasik.org/hi/articles/5d978e9f89c4660060055e0e/re-man-kyon-bhatakat-phirat-shri-narayan-swami-anurag-ras-26","author":"श्री नारायण स्वामी, अनुराग रस (26)","status":"published","content_text":"रे मन क्यों भटकत फिरत, भज श्री नन्दकुमार।\nनारायण अबहूँ समझ भयो न कछु बिगार॥\n- श्री नारायण स्वामी, अनुराग रस (26)\nअरे मन, अनंत कोटि जन्मों से तू क्यों भटक रहा है, अब श्री कृष्ण का भजन कर। श्री नारायण स्वामी कहते हैं कि अभी भी कुछ नहीं बिगड़ा है, इस बात को समझ और शरणागत हो जा।","tags":["Braj Rasik","Mass Import"],"image_urls":[],"video_urls":[],"media_links":[],"source_url":"https://www.brajrasik.org/hi/articles/5d978e9f89c4660060055e0e/re-man-kyon-bhatakat-phirat-shri-narayan-swami-anurag-ras-26","slug":"re-man-kyon-bhatakat-firata"}],"books":[],"rawItem":null}}]}]],null],null],null]},[null,["$","$L5",null,{"parallelRouterKey":"children","segmentPath":["children","saints","children","$6","children"],"error":"$undefined","errorStyles":"$undefined","errorScripts":"$undefined","template":["$","$L7",null,{}],"templateStyles":"$undefined","templateScripts":"$undefined","notFound":"$undefined","notFoundStyles":"$undefined"}]],null]},[null,["$","$L5",null,{"parallelRouterKey":"children","segmentPath":["child